// Verb semantics (2026-08-10): `deal >= M and <= N` prompts for the COUNT
// ("how many cards?" — an InputType::Number), then deals that many from the
// top automatically. `deal any` = count in 1..pile-size.
player P1
turnorder (P:P1)
location Hand on all
location Deck on table

card on Deck:
  Rank(Ace, Two, Three, Four, Five) for Suit(Hearts)

stage Play for current 1 times {
  deal >= 2 and <= 4 from Deck private to Hand of P:P1
  deal any from Deck private to Hand of P:P1
  end stage
}
